"imagine that oil with bread doth\n"
"not taste particularly good.\n"
"­"

msgctxt "object:88:0"
msgid ""
"Nur Abenteuerbücher,\n"
"wohl nach Gewicht gekauft."
msgstr ""
"Only adventure books,\n"
"likely bought by weight."

msgctxt "object:88:2"
msgid ""
"Die Bücher sind hier weit ab\n"
"von der Zivilisation wetvoll,\n"
"ich werde sie nicht verbrennen."
msgstr ""
"The books are valuable far\n"
"away from civilization;\n"
"I shall not burn them."

msgctxt "object:89:0"
msgid ""
"Eine Clownpuppe aus bun-\n"
"tem Stoff, und mit Stroh\n"
"gestopft - da sticht einer\n"
"der Stoppeln durch..."
msgstr ""
"A clown doll of colorful\n"
"fabric, stuffed with straw-\n"
"one of the stubbles pricks\n"
"through..."

msgctxt "object:90:0"
msgid ""
"Eine grüne Blechdose mit\n"
"Schwefelpulver. Das Pulver\n"
"wird wohl zur Schädlingsbe-\n"
"kämpfung verwendet."
msgstr ""
"A green tin with sulfur\n"
"powder. The powder is\n"
"likely used for pest\n"
"control."

msgctxt "object:90:4"
msgid ""
"Den Schnaps da hineinschütten\n"
"ist nicht sehr sinnvoll, der\n"
"Alkohol wird so sehr schnell\n"
"verdunsten."
msgstr ""
"Pouring liquor in there\n"
"is not very sensible;\n"
"the alcohol shall evaporate\n"
"very quickly."

msgctxt "object:90:8"
msgid ""
"Den Schnaps in die Dose schüt-\n"
"ten ist nicht sehr sinnvoll,\n"
"der Alkohol wird so schnell\n"
"verdunsten."
msgstr ""
"Pouring liquor into the tin\n"
"is not very sensible;\n"
"the alcohol shall evaporate\n"
"so quickly."

msgctxt "object:90:12"
msgid ""
"Die haben doch in der kleinen\n"
"Dose keinen Platz."
msgstr ""
"They have no space in the\n"
"small tin."

msgctxt "object:90:14"
msgid ""
"Die Kerzen sind für die Dose zu\n"
"lang."
msgstr ""
"The candles are too long\n"
"for the tin."

msgctxt "object:90:16"
msgid ""
"Nein, die Kohle muss nicht in\n"
"die Dose gepackt werden."
msgstr ""
"No, the coal need not be\n"
"packed into the tin."

msgctxt "object:90:18"
msgid ""
"Die rasseln mir zu laut in\n"
"der Blechdose."
msgstr ""
"They rattle too loudly in\n"
"the tin for my taste."

msgctxt "object:90:20"
msgid "Nein, das muss nicht sein."
msgstr "No, that need not be."

msgctxt "object:90:21"
msgid ""
"Daraus wird kein Sprengsatz,\n"
"lassen wir das."
msgstr ""
"That shall make no explosive;\n"
"let us leave that be."

msgctxt "object:90:23"
msgid ""
"Da hätte ich den Schwefel ja\n"
"gleich in der Dose lassen kön-\n"
"nen. Ich lass ihn draussen,\n"
"vielleicht brauchen wir ihn\n"
"noch."
msgstr ""
"I might as well have left the\n"
"sulfur in the tin then.\n"
"I shall leave it out; perchance\n"
"we may yet need it.\n"
"­"

msgctxt "object:90:28"
msgid ""
"Socken in der Dose. Wie originell,\n"
"aber etwas verrückt, das lass ich\n"
"sein."
msgstr ""
"Socks in the tin. How original,\n"
"yet somewhat crazy; I shall leave\n"
"it be."

msgctxt "object:90:31"
msgid "Das hat keinen Platz."
msgstr "There is no space for that."

msgctxt "object:90:32"
msgid ""
"Das Streichholz ist zur Zeit gut\n"
"aufgehoben, das muss nicht in der\n"
"Dose sein."
msgstr ""
"The match is well kept at\n"
"present; it need not be in\n"
"the tin."

msgctxt "object:90:35"
msgid ""
"Warum das Oel umschütten, die\n"
"Tasse brauch ich derzeit nicht,\n"
"und das Oel ist so gut aufgeho-\n"
"ben."
msgstr ""
"Why decant the oil? I need\n"
"not the cup at present, and the\n"
"oil is well kept as it is.\n"
"­"

msgctxt "object:90:39"
msgid "Der hat darin nicht Platz."
msgstr "It hath no space inside."

msgctxt "object:90:40"
msgid ""
"Die scheppern zu laut in der\n"
"Blechdose."
msgstr ""
"They clatter too loudly in\n"
"the tin."

msgctxt "object:91:0"
msgid ""
"Die grüne Blechdose ist\n"
"leer, den Schwefel habe\n"
"ich herausgenommen."
msgstr ""
"The green tin is empty;\n"
"I have taken out the\n"
"sulfur."

msgctxt "object:91:3"
msgid ""
"Den Schnaps da hineinschütten\n"
"ist nicht sehr sinnvoll, der\n"
"Alkohol wird so sehr schnell\n"
"verdunsten."
msgstr ""
